# IMP-09b — rendered journey in an isolated desktop instance
# command: pnpm --silent isolated-app start --build --data-root /tmp/pps-render/data-root (instance iso-54601-fd7f),
#          then /tmp/pps-render/journey.sh steps 1-10 through the browser-automation CLI attached to the instance's control port
#          (BROWSER_AUTOMATION_ATTACH_ONLY=1); the scripts are temporary diagnostics, not committed
# commit: 2c4ba2c51e (the app was built from this commit)
# environment: macOS 26.5.2 arm64, packaged AutoByteus 1.5.12-beta.10 (worktree build), test-owned data root
#              /tmp/pps-render/data-root and a test-owned fixture package /tmp/pps-render/pps-render-agents (a git repository, so
#              "package git status: []" means no package file changed); never the user's app or data
# date: 2026-11-09T08:01:50Z
#
# Steps 2 and 3 of the first pass failed in the probe script itself (collapsed tool groups have empty innerText); they were rerun
# (part 2). The rerun's save of step 2 also saved a description edit left in the open form by the failed step 3, so the package
# files changed with that description (the designed behavior: the file keeps the base tools). Step 2b repeats the personal-only
# save on a freshly loaded form, after restoring the fixture.


